WEBVTT

00:04:30.245 --> 00:04:32.825
And it requires drawing
on what the best practice

00:04:32.849 --> 00:04:35.110
and the best evidence globally tells us,

00:04:35.134 --> 00:04:36.967
but using national-level data

00:04:36.991 --> 00:04:41.712
to shine a light on the often hidden story
of violence in any given country.

00:04:41.736 --> 00:04:45.228
And using that data
to inform the national response,

00:04:45.252 --> 00:04:48.411
but also using it to measure
and track progress.

00:04:48.435 --> 00:04:49.752
And share what's working,

00:04:49.776 --> 00:04:52.204
being honest about
when things aren't working.

00:04:52.637 --> 00:04:54.390
And sharing inspiration

00:04:54.414 --> 00:04:57.454
when we see success
and violence declining.

00:04:58.613 --> 00:05:01.771
But can we really do this
on a global scale?